It is Friday evening.
I look outside through the office window.
The sky is full of dark clouds.
I think that it will rain heavily soon.
I need to go to Deepa's house now.
I open the map app on my phone.
I search for the route to Deepa's place.
The map shows heavy traffic.
I usually go by bus from Infopark.
But today, the bus journey will take a lot of time.
I feel that the bus will be very crowded.
Because of the rain, the journey will be difficult.
Therefore, I decide that I will call an auto.
An auto can go through small roads.
If I go like that, I will reach Deepa's house quickly.
I take my bag and the box of sweets.
I will get an auto from the office gate.
I walk downstairs quickly.
